From a6adb780a56fa3e7b947e9928cde6ab5b58986e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taruna Chaudhary <taruna.chaudhary@routerarchitects.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 14:52:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] [FEDERANT][MQTT] Add MQTT integration

Change Type: Enhancement

Requirement:
OpenWiFi devices require MQTT integration to exchange operational data with the uCentral stack and publish DHCP lease change notifications.

Solution:

- Add Federant MQTT UCI configuration for broker settings, uCentral topic subscription, and DHCP device classification.
- Add a procd-managed Federant MQTT service.
- Add MQTT subscription handling for /UCENTRAL_FEED and forward received payloads to ucentral health.
- Add DHCP lease monitoring and publish added/removed lease notifications to /dhcp/notification.
